<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Entitlements for Mermoz.app, mermozd and mermoz under the Hardened Runtime
  (Developer ID builds, scripts/build_app.py sign developer-id).

  Deliberately empty: the app is not sandboxed and needs no runtime exception.
  - Network (Gmail, Drive, AI providers) and the daemon's Unix socket: no entitlement
    outside the App Sandbox (com.apple.security.network.client is sandbox-only).
  - Secrets: the daemon uses the login Keychain through SecItem without the data
    protection keychain; each item's access list trusts the daemon's designated
    requirement (identifier ai.mermoz.mermozd + Team ID). keychain-access-groups would
    need a provisioning profile and is not used.
  - WKWebView, spawning mermozd and ant, opening links: no exception needed.
  - No JIT, unsigned memory, DYLD variables, third-party libraries, Apple Events,
    camera, microphone, contacts or calendars.
  Add a key here only with the feature that needs it.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict/>
</plist>
